[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（英音）]
[ti:Do You Speak English?]
[00:13.62]Did the young man speak English?
[00:19.35]I had an amusing experience last year.
[00:23.75]After I had left a small village
[00:26.80]in the south of France,
[00:29.22]I drove on to the next town.
[00:32.94]On the way, a young man waved to me.
[00:37.20]I stopped and he asked me for a lift.
[00:41.34]As soon as he had got into the car,
[00:44.39]I said good morning to him in French
[00:47.36]and he replied in the same language.
[00:51.76]Apart from a few words,
[00:54.03]I do not know any French at all.
[00:57.36]Neither of us spoke during the journey.
[01:01.28]I had nearly reached the town,
[01:04.21]when the young man suddenly said, very slowly,
[01:09.85]'Do you speak English?'
[01:15.37]As I soon learnt, he was English himself!
